---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy policy | Tingaroo"
  description="What information Tingaroo collects, why, and how to unsubscribe or ask for your data to be deleted."
>
  <article class="container container-narrow page prose">
    <!-- DRAFT: A human must review this privacy policy before launch. It is a plain-language draft, not legal advice. Replace every [BRACKETED] placeholder. -->
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>

    <h2>The short version</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Tingaroo is written for adults: parents, homeschoolers and teachers.</li>
      <li>The only personal information we ask for is your email address, and only if you sign up.</li>
      <li>We do not collect any information from children.</li>
      <li>We do not sell or rent your email address.</li>
      <li>You can unsubscribe any time.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <p>When you sign up for the free tutorial or project tips, we collect the email address you enter. We do not ask for your name, your child's name or anything else.</p>
    <!-- CONFIRM: true today. Update this sentence if analytics or cookies are added. -->
    <p>This site does not use cookies or analytics.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>Tingaroo is for adults. The signup forms are for parents and teachers only. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.</p>
    <p>If you think a child has given us their email address, email us at [CONTACT EMAIL]. We will delete it.</p>

    <h2>How we use your email address</h2>
    <p>We use it to send you the free tutorial you asked for and occasional project tips. We do not use it for anything else.</p>

    <h2>Who else handles your information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Our email service, [EMAIL PROVIDER], stores your email address and sends our emails for us.</li>
      <li>Vercel hosts this website. Like most web hosts, it processes basic technical information, such as your IP address, to deliver pages to you.</li>
      <li>The fonts on this site load from Google Fonts. Your browser connects to Google's servers to get them, so Google receives your IP address.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell, rent or trade your email address.</p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <!-- CONFIRM: retention period. -->
    <p>We keep your email address until you unsubscribe or ask us to delete it.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Unsubscribe with the link at the bottom of any email we send.</li>
      <li>Email [CONTACT EMAIL] to see, correct or delete the information we hold about you.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>If we change this policy, we will update it on this page and change the "Last updated" date at the bottom.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Tingaroo<br>[POSTAL ADDRESS]<br>Email: [CONTACT EMAIL]</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
